on and multi-agent systems for aerial platforms\n- **[R9]** Environmental and health risk assessments of fine aerosol agricultural applications\n- **[R10]** Regulatory frameworks for agricultural drones and pesticide application\n\n---\n\n*Document prepared for internal technical review of Project AEROS-RICE. This proposal describes conceptual R&D plans and does not constitute manufacturing instructions, chemical handling guidance, or operational deployment directives. All project activities will be conducted in compliance with applicable laws, regulations, and safety standards.*\n",
